{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l027","ordinal":187570,"en":"Let us bring a mighty spectacle, my son."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l028","ordinal":187571,"en":"Let us raid every horse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l029","ordinal":187572,"en":"Of that Kalcha slave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l030","ordinal":187573,"en":"Then grow fat and refreshed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l031","ordinal":187574,"en":"Yesterday, truly, those few people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l032","ordinal":187575,"en":"Who let themselves be taken to Kakan-Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l033","ordinal":187576,"en":"Must have had weak horses."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l034","ordinal":187577,"en":"Let us prepare swift horses;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l035","ordinal":187578,"en":"Their clothing must have worn out,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l036","ordinal":187579,"en":"So let us prepare strong clothing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l037","ordinal":187580,"en":"These numerous Chinese people—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l038","ordinal":187581,"en":"Their multitude is like black worms."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l039","ordinal":187582,"en":"Let us consult Chyiyrdy and Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l001","ordinal":187583,"en":"Take counsel with Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l002","ordinal":187584,"en":"And prepare ample provisions well."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l003","ordinal":187585,"en":"Let us deliberate together;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l004","ordinal":187586,"en":"Then afterward, in Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l005","ordinal":187587,"en":"Let us create a great tale."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l006","ordinal":187588,"en":"My son, Beijing is no playground;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l007","ordinal":187589,"en":"Gated Beijing with its royal court"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l008","ordinal":187590,"en":"Is no place for games."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l009","ordinal":187591,"en":"It has a desert forty days across,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l010","ordinal":187592,"en":"An accursed land such as this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l011","ordinal":187593,"en":"My son, whoever has inhabited Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l012","ordinal":187594,"en":"Those who attacked Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l013","ordinal":187595,"en":"Never turned back to see their homes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l014","ordinal":187596,"en":"Beijing's forty-day expanse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l015","ordinal":187597,"en":"Has a broad river road."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l016","ordinal":187598,"en":"Misery awaits whoever encounters it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l017","ordinal":187599,"en":"Precisely aimed at them,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l018","ordinal":187600,"en":"There lies a stretched net."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l019","ordinal":187601,"en":"Whoever falls upon accursed Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l020","ordinal":187602,"en":"Has misery from which he cannot recover."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l021","ordinal":187603,"en":"The sand blazes with heat;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l022","ordinal":187604,"en":"Set a cauldron upon it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l023","ordinal":187605,"en":"And it boils roaring and surging."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l024","ordinal":187606,"en":"Before one can say a word,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l025","ordinal":187607,"en":"In the blink of an eye,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l026","ordinal":187608,"en":"Not a spoonful of water remains."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l027","ordinal":187609,"en":"One reaches the deathless desert;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l028","ordinal":187610,"en":"If you encounter that desert,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l029","ordinal":187611,"en":"My foal, your strength will leave you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l030","ordinal":187612,"en":"Let us not be caught unawares;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l031","ordinal":187613,"en":"So the sun's force cannot penetrate,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l032","ordinal":187614,"en":"Let us prepare our clothing well."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l033","ordinal":187615,"en":"If your stride reaches those many people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l034","ordinal":187616,"en":"Let us drive them all away."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l035","ordinal":187617,"en":"With wise Bakai leading the road,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l036","ordinal":187618,"en":"Taking no fewer than sixty thousand troops,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l037","ordinal":187619,"en":"And abundant provisions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l038","ordinal":187620,"en":"For that great army to eat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l039","ordinal":187621,"en":"Taking plentiful provisions with us,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l001","ordinal":187622,"en":"With the moon as our streaming banner,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l002","ordinal":187623,"en":"With clamor splitting the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l003","ordinal":187624,"en":"With the sun as our streaming banner,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l004","ordinal":187625,"en":"With clamor splitting the blue heavens,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l005","ordinal":187626,"en":"Then let us make war."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l006","ordinal":187627,"en":"Stripping him of horse and armor,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l007","ordinal":187628,"en":"Let us make hero Khan Kongurbai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l008","ordinal":187629,"en":"Into such a spectacle."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l009","ordinal":187630,"en":"Upon the Kalcha, khan of the monks,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l010","ordinal":187631,"en":"Let us bring turmoil that cannot be crossed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l011","ordinal":187632,"en":"From that Kalcha, khan of the monks,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l012","ordinal":187633,"en":"Let us exact our vengeance."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l013","ordinal":187634,"en":"Let horses grow fat and ready,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l014","ordinal":187635,"en":"And the gathered army stand massed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l015","ordinal":187636,"en":"May resolute youths and swift horses"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l016","ordinal":187637,"en":"Reach the time when they prove useful."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l017","ordinal":187638,"en":"My son, if you heed me, do this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l018","ordinal":187639,"en":"May the road be blessed by saints;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l019","ordinal":187640,"en":"For Beijing, let there be"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l020","ordinal":187641,"en":"No fewer than one hundred twenty thousand troops."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l021","ordinal":187642,"en":"If you make war upon Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l022","ordinal":187643,"en":"Let them be abundant, not few."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l023","ordinal":187644,"en":"Let renowned giants come,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l024","ordinal":187645,"en":"Heroes come to Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l025","ordinal":187646,"en":"Who do not retreat a hair from death,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l026","ordinal":187647,"en":"Who never turn away from dying;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0020:b003:l027","ordinal":187648,"en":"Let such warriors come to Beijing."}]
